{"complete":true,"city":"Moscow","template_id":"global-where-locals-linger","title":"Where Locals Linger: 10 Places to Sit for Hours","description":"Ten Moscow setups built for unhurried time: reading rooms with desks and power, quiet coworking spaces, and parks furnished with benches, tables, shade, and loungers.","icon":"weekend","cards":[{"entity_name":"Zaryadye Park","title":"Zaryadye Park","subtitle":"Hundreds of benches threaded through the park’s landscape zones","notes":"Wide resting steps, illuminated seats, and oak-and-stone benches line the central paths. The city’s project page describes free, round-the-clock park access; individual attractions may operate separately.","short_summary":"Follow the paths until the view and the right-shaped bench line up.","source_url":"https://stroi.mos.ru/park-zariad-ie","source_title":"Парк «Зарядье» — Комплекс градостроительной политики и строительства города Москвы","latitude":55.7514578,"longitude":37.6287988,"place_id":"ChIJIa7uAFhKtUYRRWeoyNDZL6U","maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJIa7uAFhKtUYRRWeoyNDZL6U"},{"entity_name":"Green River Park","title":"Green River Park","subtitle":"Tables under a canopy, loungers, hammocks, and a covered public room","notes":"The Lefortovo section includes four tables with benches beneath a pergola and ten loungers on sand. A larger roofed area adds hammocks, game tables, and amphitheater seating for weather-resistant pauses.","short_summary":"Bring a book to the pergola, or move under the larger roof when the weather turns.","source_url":"https://stroi.mos.ru/press_releases/anastasiia-piatova-zaviershien-novyi-uchastok-parka-zielionaia-rieka-v-liefortovie","source_title":"Анастасия Пятова: Завершен новый участок парка «Зелёная река» в Лефортове","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Russian State Library","title":"Russian State Library","subtitle":"Thirty-four reading rooms with more than 1,600 seats","notes":"A reader pass opens a substantial choice of desks, specialized rooms, computer access, and reader areas. The library says Russian and foreign citizens aged 14 or older can obtain a pass with identification.","short_summary":"Choose the room by subject, then settle into one of the library’s many formal work seats.","source_url":"https://www.rsl.ru/visit-to-rsl","source_title":"Visit the Library — Russian State Library","latitude":55.7517701,"longitude":37.6088686,"place_id":"ChIJoTopjFFKtUYRrlnHuUxMa10","maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJoTopjFFKtUYRrlnHuUxMa10"},{"entity_name":"State Public Historical Library of Russia","title":"State Public Historical Library of Russia","subtitle":"An 80-seat reading hall with laptop-equipped places","notes":"The main hall combines long-form desk work with more than 10,000 open-shelf volumes. Registration is required; the library publishes separate registration and reading-room schedules.","short_summary":"A practical desk-and-laptop room when the day’s subject is history—or simply sustained concentration.","source_url":"https://www.shpl.ru/readers/reading_rooms/","source_title":"Читальные залы — Государственная публичная историческая библиотека России","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Russian State Library for Young Adults","title":"Russian State Library for Young Adults","subtitle":"Reading tables with power sockets and library-wide Wi-Fi","notes":"Every reading table has an electrical outlet for personal laptops. The building also offers open Wi-Fi, public computers, subject rooms, a study room, and an armchair listening setup for audiobooks.","short_summary":"A plugged-in library day with several rooms to change pace without leaving the building.","source_url":"https://rgub.ru/library/technologies.php","source_title":"Технологии — Российская государственная библиотека для молодежи","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Miguel Delibes Library at Instituto Cervantes Moscow","title":"Miguel Delibes Library at Instituto Cervantes Moscow","subtitle":"Nineteen work seats in a quiet reading room open to all visitors","notes":"Most of the Spanish-language collection is open-shelf, and three computers handle audio and video materials. The library asks readers to keep conversations quiet and leave finished books on the tables or collection cart.","short_summary":"A small, clearly structured room for reading Spanish-language books at a proper desk.","source_url":"https://moscu.cervantes.es/ru/biblioteka_ispanskiy/uslugi_biblioteka_ispanskiy/chitalny_zal.htm","source_title":"Читальный зал в библиотеке — Институт Сервантеса в Москве","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Pushkin Library Family Reading Department","title":"Pushkin Library Family Reading Department","subtitle":"Separate coworking and computer-work spaces for different age groups","notes":"This branch at 16 Bolshaya Pochtovaya divides its ground floor into children’s, youth, and adult sectors. Alongside the work areas are rooms for games, lectures, screenings, and workshops; consult the branch-specific schedule before going.","short_summary":"Pick the age-appropriate sector, then use the dedicated coworking setup instead of improvising at a café table.","source_url":"https://pushkinmoslib.ru/","source_title":"Библиотека-читальня им. А.С. Пушкина — официальный сайт","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Nikolay Dobrolyubov Library","title":"Nikolay Dobrolyubov Library","subtitle":"Reading rooms configured as an adult coworking space","notes":"The library explicitly pairs its reading rooms with Wi-Fi and access to the National Electronic Library and LitRes. Reader registration is available on site; non-Russian residents are directed to register in person.","short_summary":"A conventional reading room with the network access needed for a longer research session.","source_url":"https://mosmuseum.ru/association/dobrolubova/for-visitors/","source_title":"Посетителям библиотеки — Библиотека имени Н.А. Добролюбова, Музей Москвы","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Library No. 41, Kuusinena Street Branch","title":"Library No. 41, Kuusinena Street Branch","subtitle":"A reading room with Wi-Fi, public computers, newspapers, and magazines","notes":"The Northern Administrative District’s official cultural network lists the specific setup at 6 Kuusinena Street, Building 6. It is a straightforward branch option for desk work or a long pass through current periodicals.","short_summary":"Come for a computer or Wi-Fi; stay at the reading-room desk with the newspaper rack nearby.","source_url":"https://kulturasao.ru/","source_title":"Библиотеки — Культурный центр САО","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Rudomino All-Russia State Library for Foreign Literature","title":"Rudomino Library for Foreign Literature","subtitle":"Two levels of reading space plus smaller study rooms","notes":"The library’s visitor directions map a lower and upper tier, a small reading room, a document-issue hall, and several language and cultural centers. The published reading-room schedule extends through the day; registration requirements should be checked before arrival.","short_summary":"Start in the two-level reading hall, then shift to a smaller room when you need a tighter focus.","source_url":"https://libfl.ru/ru/contacts","source_title":"Контактная информация — Библиотека иностранной литературы","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null}],"warnings":[]}
