nger research session.","source_url":"https://mosmuseum.ru/association/dobrolubova/for-visitors/","source_title":"Посетителям библиотеки — Библиотека имени Н.А. Добролюбова, Музей Москвы","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Library No. 41, Kuusinena Street Branch","title":"Library No. 41, Kuusinena Street Branch","subtitle":"A reading room with Wi-Fi, public computers, newspapers, and magazines","notes":"The Northern Administrative District’s official cultural network lists the specific setup at 6 Kuusinena Street, Building 6. It is a straightforward branch option for desk work or a long pass through current periodicals.","short_summary":"Come for a computer or Wi-Fi; stay at the reading-room desk with the newspaper rack nearby.","source_url":"https://kulturasao.ru/","source_title":"Библиотеки — Культурный центр САО","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Rudomino All-Russia State Library for Foreign Literature","title":"Rudomino Library for Foreign Literature","subtitle":"Two levels of reading space plus smaller study rooms","notes":"The library’s visitor directions map a lower and upper tier, a small reading room, a document-issue hall, and several language and cultural centers. The published reading-room schedule extends through the day; registration requirements should be checked before arrival.","short_summary":"Start in the two-level reading hall, then shift to a smaller room when you need a tighter focus.","source_url":"https://libfl.ru/ru/contacts","source_title":"Контактная информация — Библиотека иностранной литературы","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null}],"warnings":[]}
